  onto it) + built `protocols/registry.rs` (`RegistryServer` + `versions`/`fetch`/`publish` +
  a deterministic FNV `checksum`) on it — same door, same boundary byte-codec, same `algebra`
  join. Two registries `merge`-converge with no coordinator (`tests/registry_transport.rs`).
  pkg owns `RemoteRegistry` (chrysalis); seam in `to_pkg`. [[mesh_as_protocol]]
- **mesh M1 ladder COMPLETE:** closure invariant → `mesh:` protocol → live bridge →
